==Strategy==
==='''Chapters 1 & 2'''===
If you started playing Into the Future right after obtaining all Superior [[Treasure]]s in [[Empire of Cats]], this is where spamming [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Giraffe Cats]] may not earn you all the [[Timed Score Reward]]s. Helmut Krabbe's Area Attack and attack power allows him to juggle a stack of Giraffe Cats all at once. Instead, spam [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Whale Cats]] or [[:Category:Anti-Alien Cats|anti-Alien cats]] to earn every Timed Score Reward here.

==='''Chapter 3'''===
Calamary's extreme range and weaken effect are all that stand between you and a surprisingly frail enemy. She may take a long time to defeat, but that time can be drastically reduced by stacking [[Crazed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Sexy Legs Cats]] to hit her with [[Wave Attack|waves]]. [[:Category:Cats with Weaken Immunity|Cats with Weaken Immunity]] (like [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Cyborg]]) will also have an easy time getting to her, and [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Butterfly Cat]] can do great damage even if it is affected by Calamary's ability. Use [[Ururun Wolf (Special Cat)|Ururun Cat]]'s rapid Area Attacks for the Ginger Snaches.

